Package: deltaMethod
Title: Delta Method Standard Errors and Confidence Intervals
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Delta method sampling variance-covariance matrices,
    standard errors, test statistics, and confidence intervals
    for functions of parameters using a numerical Jacobian.
    The functions take either a vector of estimates with its
    sampling variance-covariance matrix and an R function,
    or a fitted model object and character strings that define
    functions of its coefficients.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/deltaMethod,
        https://ijapesigan.github.io/deltaMethod/
